  m_Name: Dial_Reynard_CheckInOffer
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerNpcId: reynard
  playerFacingPolicy: 0
  lines:
  - speakerName: Reynard
    text: Toby sent you? Ha! That old dog runs on coffee and beer, and he is fresh
      out of both.
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: reynard
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Reynard
    text: Zeb, my courier, went for the beans and never came back. Probably stuck
      on the trail, and may need help
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: reynard
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Reynard
    text: Follow the path out of Loomville and keep going until the jungle closes
      over the road. Watch for Zeb and his cart
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: reynard
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Reynard
    text: The trail has been unusually mean lately.. must be that part of the cycle...
      Take this Nitro Brew! It'll get you to him faster
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: reynard
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
